# Nucleus Design System

## Color Tokens (Use These Exactly — Never Hardcode Other Values)
```
Background:        #0a0a0f   → bg-[#0a0a0f]
Card background:   #0f0f17   → bg-[#0f0f17]
Hover state:       #111118   → hover:bg-[#111118]
Border:            #ffffff10 → border-[#ffffff10]
Violet accent:     #7c5cfc   → bg-[#7c5cfc] / text-[#7c5cfc]
Text primary:      white
Text muted:        text-white/40 or text-white/60
```

## Cluster Color Presets (Only These Six)
```
#7c5cfc  (violet — default)
#3b82f6  (blue)
#10b981  (green)
#f59e0b  (amber)
#ef4444  (red)
#ec4899  (pink)
```

## Priority Colors (Tasks)
```
low:    bg-green-500/15 text-green-400
medium: bg-yellow-500/15 text-yellow-400
high:   bg-red-500/15 text-red-400
```

## Typography
- Font: System default (no Google Fonts imports)
- All AI/markdown content: `prose prose-invert` classes via react-markdown
- Never increase font sizes beyond what's already established in the codebase

## Component Patterns

### Cards
```tsx
<div className="bg-[#0f0f17] border border-[#ffffff10] rounded-xl p-4">
```

### Hover states on interactive items
```tsx
className="hover:bg-[#111118] transition-colors cursor-pointer"
```

### Violet accent buttons (primary actions)
```tsx
<Button className="bg-[#7c5cfc] hover:bg-[#6d4ff0] text-white">
```

### Muted/secondary text
```tsx
<span className="text-white/40">  // very muted
<span className="text-white/60">  // slightly muted
```

### Empty states
```tsx
<div className="text-center py-12 text-white/40">
  <Icon className="w-8 h-8 mx-auto mb-3 opacity-50" />
  <p className="text-sm">Descriptive message here</p>
</div>
```

### Section headers inside pages
```tsx
<div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
  <h2 className="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Title</h2>
  <Button variant="outline" size="sm">Action</Button>
</div>
```

## Rules
- Never use Tailwind's default white background — always use the dark tokens above
- Never add drop shadows or box shadows unless already present in adjacent components
- Never use `rounded-2xl` or larger — stick to `rounded-xl` max for cards, `rounded-lg` for smaller elements
- Never use colored backgrounds other than the design tokens — no `bg-blue-500`, no `bg-purple-600`
- Borders are always `border-[#ffffff10]` — never `border-gray-700` or similar
- All modals/dialogs use the same dark card background `#0f0f17`
- Spacing scale: use Tailwind defaults (p-4, p-6, gap-4) — no arbitrary spacing values
- Never use inline styles — always Tailwind classes
